      "identity_excerpt": "□ □ __________________________________________________________________________________________ __________________________________________________________________________________________ AFFIDAVIT OF ENTITLEMENT FOR ESTATES PURSUANT TO NRS 146.080 STATE OF _____________ ) ) COUNTY OF ___________ ) I, (your name) _________________________________, residing at the address listed below, being first duly sworn upon oath, hereby affirm: Decedent (insert decedent’s name) _____________________________________ died in the County of (insert county of death) ____________________, State of (insert state of death) ____________________, on the (insert date of death) _____ day of _______________, 20___, being a resident of the State of (insert state where decedent lived at time of death) ____________________, leaving an estate in the County of Clark, State of Nevada. Decedent’s estate did not include real property nor a lien thereon. I affirm that (check one box): I am the surviving spouse of the decedent and the gross value of the estate, except amounts due the decedent for services in the Armed Forces of the United States or the value of any motor vehicles registered to decedent, is not in excess of $150,000.00. I am not the surviving spouse of the decedent, but I am the person who has a right to succeed the property of the decedent, or I am a beneficiary of the decedent’s Last Will and Testament, and the gross value of the estate, except amounts due the decedent for services in the Armed Forces of the United States or the value of any motor vehicles registered to decedent, is not in excess of $25,000.00. Decedent’s estate consists of the following: (Write the assets you need transferred, such as: bank account, stock certificate, insurance proceeds, payroll check, etc., and the port",
